						src={hyperstar}
						alt="HyperStar Screenshot"
						width="200"
					/>
				</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="https://github.com/jojoferret/graveyard-api"
					><code>graveyard-api</code></a
				>: What can I even say about this. It just a crud with auth and
				ratelimiting, for your forgotten idea, apps, startups
				<br />
				<strong>Why?</strong>
				<blockquote>
					Because not every idea gets finished.
					<br />
					Because not every project needs to be forgotten.
					<br />
					Because you deserve to laugh (or cry) at what you never shipped.
				</blockquote>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="https://github.com/foxy4096/Ineq"><code>Ineq</code></a
				>: It's a 2d procedurally side platformer game which I made in
				godot. It's like 2d minecraft or Terraria.
				<br />
				<a href="images/ineq-main-menu.png">
					<Image
						src={ineq_ss}
						alt="ineq game main menu screenshot"
						width="200"
						loading="lazy"
					/>
				</a>
				<iframe
					width="200"
					height="125"
					src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/U75W2vA6aUg?si=vTgHChe8XtBuufHm"
					title="Ineq Game Demo"
					frameborder="0"
