				had deployed on the server. But the god had other plans. During the
				development of PingFox I got really sick and got admitted to hospital
				and doctors said that my kidneys are all cooked and there is no way
				to recover from this. Now the only course is hemodialysis. So now
				I am currently on hemodialysis. I feel like this PingFox should now
				be published to the
				<code>graveyard-api</code> as now this project is dead. If you think
				you can revive, sure try to, contact me for the access.
				<br />
				<a href="images/pingfox-static-home.jpeg">
